3. **Marginalia** — the notes in the margins of a page. Evokes design thinking, annotation, the details other people skip. A bit intellectual, great for an editorial-led studio.

4. **Hill & Hue** — alliterative and memorable; "hill" gives it that Lisbon topography, "hue" signals colour and visual work. Very brandable.

5. **Forma Fina** — Portuguese-meets-Italian feel, "fine form"; sounds crafted and confident, works for packaging, identity, or spatial design.

